I stand at the empty court.
A young woman comes over to me.
Two men are with her.
The woman smiles at me.
Here in the sports club, everyone says "du".
"Hello, I am Lena," she says.
She points at the two men.
"And these are Timo and Max."
Timo and Max also say hello.
"I am Maya," I answer.
Lena looks at my racket.
"Do you want to play a doubles match with us?" she asks.
I nod immediately.
"Yes, I very much want to play with you," I say.
Max smiles.
"Can you run fast?" he asks.
"Yes, I can run very fast," I answer.
Timo takes a shuttlecock in his hand.
"Super, then we play," Lena says.
We walk onto the court together.
